# reports.case on sw_aki2120.SAV (a case takes its save from its first step).
# The main map's F-key screens, one at a time: each key, then Escape to close what it opened.
# F12 is different: it shows the faction and Council panel on the map without taking the keys,
# so F12 again hides it (Escape there would open "Do you really want to quit?"). The case ends on
# the map with no popup open.
save sw_aki2120.SAV
keys {F1}
keys {ESC}
keys {F2}
keys {ESC}
keys {F3}
keys {ESC}
keys {F4}
keys {ESC}
keys {F5}
keys {ESC}
keys {F6}
keys {ESC}
keys {F7}
keys {ESC}
keys {F8}
keys {ESC}
keys {F9}
keys {ESC}
keys {F10}
keys {ESC}
keys {F11}
keys {ESC}
keys {F12}
keys {F12}
